---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Qaraye Marchants collects, uses, and protects your data.">
  <div class="container" style="padding: 60px 24px; max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--display); font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink);">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 40px;">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div style="color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem;">

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you use Qaraye Marchants, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Phone number, email address, business name, profile photo, and other details you provide.</li>
        <li><strong>Listing information:</strong> Products, descriptions, prices, images, and videos you upload.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Pages visited, products viewed, and interactions with listings.</li>
        <li><strong>Device information:</strong> Browser type, IP address, and device type for security and analytics.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide and improve the Qaraye Marchants marketplace</li>
        <li>Connect buyers with verified merchants</li>
        <li>Prevent fraud and enforce our Terms of Service</li>
        <li>Send transactional emails (password resets, order confirmations)</li>
        <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve the platform</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">3. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Service providers who help us operate the platform (hosting, email, analytics)</li>
        <li>Law enforcement when legally required</li>
        <li>Other users as needed to facilitate transactions (e.g., merchant business names are public)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">4. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to keep you signed in, remember your theme preferences, and understand how the site is used. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">5. Third-Party Advertising</h2>
      <p>We may display advertising through Google AdSense and other partners. These providers may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" style="color: var(--cyan);">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use industry-standard measures to protect your data, including encrypted connections (HTTPS), secure password hashing, and access controls. No system is 100% secure — please use a strong, unique password.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You can access, update, or delete your account information at any time from your profile page. To request deletion of all your data, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@qarayemarchants.com.ng" style="color: var(--cyan);">support@qarayemarchants.com.ng</a>.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Qaraye Marchants is not intended for users under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be announced on the site. Continued use after changes means you accept the updated policy.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">10. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:support@qarayemarchants.com.ng" style="color: var(--cyan);">support@qarayemarchants.com.ng</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>